/E (2.1      For employees, the best time to grant equity is as early as possible to maximise their potential upside. It offers the founders a commercial advantage for rewarding exceptional performance and innovation, attracting highly skilled professionals where cash compensation is limited, and providing advisors with meaningful incentives without significant upfront financial commitments.  Additional benefits include: )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
347 0 obj
<<
