534 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 119 0 R
/E (Equity is far more than a percentage on a cap table. It represents ownership, control, opportunity, and long-term value. Every decision relating to equity has legal, commercial, financial, and governance implications that can shape the future of a business.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
535 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 119 0 R
/E (Founders who approach equity strategically by documenting transactions properly, complying with legal requirements, and planning for future growth place themselves in a stronger position to attract investment, retain talent, and build resilient businesses.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
536 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
