/P 119 0 R
/E (Whether you are allocating founder equity, designing employee incentive schemes, or preparing for your next funding round, obtaining appropriate legal advice at the outset can prevent costly disputes and protect the long-term interests of both the company and its stakeholders.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
