/Title (Once shares are issued, Section 154 CAMA requires the company to file a Return of Allotment with the Corporate Affairs Commission \(CAC\) within one month. This filing gives the transaction proper legal recognition. Without it, the investment may exist as a contract between parties, but it will lack regulatory standing, which could have a significant adverse effect for future fundraising activities.)
